WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,270 --> 00:00:01,170
Gao Xunwen

2
00:00:01,350 --> 00:00:02,430
Did you go to the river?

3
00:00:02,670 --> 00:00:05,510
An old man said that he had delicious food at his house and I didn’t want it.

4
00:00:05,710 --> 00:00:07,150
He just kept tugging on my clothes

5
00:00:07,150 --> 00:00:08,670
I was anxious to push him down

6
00:00:09,350 --> 00:00:10,630
He pulled my ankles

7
00:00:10,630 --> 00:00:11,950
Drag me into the water

8
00:00:11,950 --> 00:00:17,470
I saw you when I woke up. Daddy's side

9
00:00:17,470 --> 00:00:19,630
Please explain clearly how you died first

10
00:00:19,630 --> 00:00:20,750
Why can't I go home?

11
00:00:20,750 --> 00:00:22,190
I don't remember where home is

12
00:00:22,590 --> 00:00:25,350
I only remember that the day I died was 1985

13
00:00:25,870 --> 00:00:27,120
I was not born in 1985

14
00:00:27,120 --> 00:00:28,080
I know where to go

15
00:00:28,080 --> 00:00:30,640
Go to Lao Li's house at the head of the village and ask him if he has something to bring.

16
00:00:30,920 --> 00:00:35,790
That old boy can't let go. Who are you, Uncle Li?

17
00:00:35,910 --> 00:00:37,710
I would like to inquire about my personal side

18
00:00:38,030 --> 00:00:39,310
What is your relationship with Wei Ning?

19
00:00:39,310 --> 00:00:40,710
You can't be his son, right?

20
00:00:41,070 --> 00:00:43,310
I've long heard that he left a seed behind before he died.

21
00:00:43,310 --> 00:00:44,910
There is no good thing in the family

22
00:00:44,910 --> 00:00:47,910
See if I don’t beat you to death, you’re laughing, bastard Uncle Li

23
00:00:47,910 --> 00:00:49,150
I don’t know Wei Ning

24
00:00:49,470 --> 00:00:50,510
I had a dream

25
00:00:50,510 --> 00:00:52,110
In the dream there was a woman named Fang Xia

26
00:00:52,110 --> 00:00:54,950
Do you really want me to come to this village to find his parents?

27
00:00:54,950 --> 00:00:55,870
i know him

28
00:00:55,870 --> 00:00:56,910
The girl from Lao Fang’s family

29
00:00:56,910 --> 00:00:58,510
No yin training for more than 30 years

30
00:00:58,790 --> 00:01:00,310
Since you had this dream

31
00:01:00,670 --> 00:01:03,230
She must be dead, then her family members

32
00:01:03,230 --> 00:01:04,390
When Wei Ning was shot

33
00:01:04,390 --> 00:01:06,950
It was the last time I accompanied Lao Fang to see him

34
00:01:06,950 --> 00:01:09,150
That poisonous bastard died in Lintou

35
00:01:09,150 --> 00:01:11,110
It didn’t say whether he was dead or alive.

36
00:01:12,180 --> 00:01:13,420
The girl's life or death is unknown

37
00:01:13,420 --> 00:01:15,100
Lao Fang fell ill after seeing Wei Ning

38
00:01:15,100 --> 00:01:16,340
He left soon

39
00:01:16,340 --> 00:01:18,380
Before he died, he still recited his name

40
00:01:18,380 --> 00:01:19,580
Lao Fang’s wife can’t bear it

41
00:01:19,580 --> 00:01:20,620
I cried blindly all of a sudden

42
00:01:21,340 --> 00:01:22,740
Fortunately, I have a filial son left

43
00:01:22,740 --> 00:01:24,900
Take him to the city to serve Uncle Li

44
00:01:24,900 --> 00:01:25,900
Where is his family?

45
00:01:25,900 --> 00:01:27,740
County new community 501

46
00:01:27,740 --> 00:01:29,660
His son’s name is Fang Mingli and he is a policeman

47
00:01:29,660 --> 00:01:32,500
I seem to remember this place
